add('C01-S10-A2',rough+'NEW TIGHT LOW shot: ONE normal BLACK-gloved human hand reaching from left picks up a LOOSE chain on the DRY floor beside ONE red cart front caster at right. Chain is not yet attached. One caster fork clearly connected to its cart frame. Handle, people, legs and bodies OUT OF FRAME. No other hands, carts, text or red gloves. Chain and hand fill half the image.', ['C01-S03-A2','C01-S05-A1'])
