add('C01-S12-A2',rough+'NEW intimate release shot. ONE normal BLACK-gloved human hand withdraws to the left, small healthy exposed wrist and charcoal work sleeve. ONE pale ordinary five-finger hand from a wet gray sleeve is OPEN and separated from the human wrist by at least 10 cm, short natural nails. They no longer touch. Red cart frame and a taut chain at caster softly visible behind; floor dry. No injury, no marks, no extra fingers or arms, no face, no sharp nails. Ordinary natural hand anatomy.', ['C01-S01-A1','C01-S09-A1'])
add('C01-S12-A0',rough+'NEW low side detail. ONE normal BLACK-gloved free hand loosely wraps a disconnected chain around a fixed steel bollard on dry concrete. A cart caster at right remains flat on the ground. The chain is SLACK with sagging loops, not taut, not locked yet. Only one hand; all other arms, wrists, bodies, heads and other carts are outside the frame. Close framing on chain links and glove. No visible rear door.', ['C01-S12-A1','C01-S05-A1'],version='')
add('C01-S13-A2',rough+'Aftermath: over-shoulder chest-down view of a charcoal-jacket supermarket worker quietly checking their own sleeve cuff with their other hand. Arms are FULLY COVERED by charcoal work jacket, black work gloves. Ordinary healthy hands, no visible wrist skin. Another worker stands beside them cropped at shoulders. Dry shelter concrete and gray wall, no ghost, no body detail, no injury, no marks, no text.', ['C01-S05-A1'],version='')
add('C01-S15-A1',rough+'Daylight ending, new camera outside a different modern supermarket. Faceless back of a shopper in a plain charcoal jacket looks toward an ordinary cart shelter. Several nested BLUE-handle steel carts partly hidden behind a structural pillar. All ground and handles completely dry. Pale overcast daylight, subdued blue-gray palette, subtle amber store light. No red tape, no entity, no abnormal anatomy, no text.', ['C01-S02-A1'],version='')
add('C01-S15-A2',rough+'Daylight ending close-up of an ordinary healthy shopper hand casually resting on a completely DRY BLUE supermarket cart handle. Plain charcoal sleeve covers the wrist. Five natural fingers, short ordinary nails. Bright matte dry floor blurred in background. No other hand, no red tape, no water, no injury, no marks or compression, no entity. Restrained unease through empty space only.', ['C01-S02-A1'],version='')
