add('C02-S05-A2','A single landscape dark painterly gouache horror scene, midnight blue and amber light, not photographic. New EXTREME SIDE PROFILE detail of a noise-barrier thin STEEL PANEL bowing OUTWARD TOWARD a worker fingertip. The bolted side edges stay fixed, panel center protrudes convexly 5 cm toward camera; clear bent silhouette from side. ONE normal black work glove touches a fixed bolt at the edge, not the bulging center. Narrow upper grated inspection walkway below; all faces and creature out of frame. No concave dent, no inward hole, no extra arms or text.', ['C02-S04-A1'],version='v2')
